cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >
  If you use this code, please cite both the software release and the
  associated Heliyon publication. The Zenodo DOI ensures reproducibility
  and long-term archival of the exact version used in the study.
title: "bio_math_model_images: MATLAB pipeline for vesicle detection and exocytosis analysis"
type: software
version: v1.0-doi
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.17342495
repository-code: "https://github.com/dabhimanyu/bio_math_model_images"
url: "https://github.com/dabhimanyu/bio_math_model_images/releases/tag/v1.0-doi"
abstract: >
  This release (v1.0-doi) is an immutable, Zenodo-archived snapshot of the
  MATLAB codebase used in the Heliyon paper by Makam et al. (2024). It
  provides a reproducible pipeline for semi-automatic detection of insulin
  granule exocytosis in human pancreatic β-cells using TIRF microscopy.
  The pipeline includes pre-processing, vesicle localisation, trajectory
  tracking, and classification of docking and exocytosis events.
